婅緸锛屼簩濂跺ザ璧跺繖鍙�鏉庡�堝�堜翰鑷�閫佹煶钃夊嚭闂ㄣ��", "鏌宠搲鐐逛簡鐐瑰ご锛屾墠鍜屾潕濡堝�堜竴璧峰悜澶栬蛋锛屽緟寰楄蛋鍒板眿澶栵紝濂规墠浣庡０瀵圭潃鏉庡�堝�堝槺鍜愶細鈥滆繖娈垫椂闂翠竴瀹氳�佺収椤惧ソ浜嗭紝瀛╁瓙铏界劧鏄�鐢熶笅鏉ヤ簡锛屽彲鐜板湪鎵嶆槸浜屽ザ濂跺嵄闄╃殑寮�濮嬶紝鍙�鏈変激鍙ｉ兘鎰堝悎浜嗭紝鎵嶆槸鐪熸�ｇ殑濂姐�傗��", "鈥滆�屼笖锛屼互鍚庤嫢鏈�**浠�涔堢殑锛屼竴瀹氳�佸皬蹇冧笉鑳芥湁瀛╁瓙锛屽惁鍒欌�斺�旇偗瀹氫細姣嶅瓙涓嶄繚锛佲��", "鈥滄垜鐭ラ亾锛屾垜浼氬湪浜屽ザ濂跺ソ浜嗕箣鍚庯紝鍛婅瘔浜屽ザ濂剁殑銆傗�濇潕濡堝�堣�寸潃锛岀姽璞�浜嗕竴涓嬶紝鎵嶅�圭潃鏌宠搲寮�鍙ｏ細鈥滀綘涔濆�戝�戣嚜灏忓彈瀹狅紝浣犲拰涔濆�戝�樹竴璧疯窡鐫�鏁欏吇濡堝�堝�︿範锛屼竴瀹氳�佷粩缁嗐�傗��", "鐪嬬潃鏉庡�堝�堣�ょ湡鎷呭咖鐨勭溂绁烇紝鏌宠搲缁堜簬闇插嚭浠婃棩绗�涓�涓�鐪熷績鐨勫井绗戯紝杞昏交鐨勫�圭潃鏉庡�堝�堢偣澶达細鈥滃棷锛屾垜鐞嗕細鐨勩�傗��"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "侯门医女", "content_zh": "第九章 剖腹产“啊！”刘大奶奶不禁惊呼：“蓉姐儿疯了，她……她这哪里是在救人，分明是在杀人！”太夫人虽然同样受惊，却是紧紧的抓住大夫人的手臂，只将大夫人拽的连惊恐的心思分散一半。二夫人忍不住捂脸，完了，完了，这样的遗体叫亲家看到，恐怕就毁掉了。不行，若是二奶奶去了，就将蓉姐儿直接送官，将一切都推倒她头上！不对，不是推，本来就是她做的好事！史御医别过脸，这蓉姐儿也太胡闹了，就这么划下去，若是万一失手……不，怕是肯定会失手！可惜如此聪慧的姑娘，本是个学医的好苗子，哎，今日怕是要毁掉了！柳博心中虽然不喜二奶奶给自己生下弟弟，可看到这一幕也忍不住闭眼，他继母这次恐怕是真的活不了。上官辰皱眉，之前虽然支持柳蓉，可这会心底也忍不住担忧，即便是个正常人，这么下去恐怕也完了，更何况还是肚子里还了孩子的孕妇。柳蓉却是完全集中注意力，她本来不想这样纵向由脐部下方至**上方这样划开，毕竟这样的方式会影响一个女性下一次受孕，会增加二奶奶第二胎时**破裂的风险。但是现在再横向以二奶奶的情况来说已经来不及了，因为只有纵向，才能流最少的血，最快的取出孩子。而在现在这样的情况，没有输血的工具补充孕妇体内的血液，也必须以流血最少的方式来进行。柳蓉深吸一口气，她必须快！不然血流失的多了，孕妇就保不住了。偏偏越想快，手上的速度就越慢。必须冷静，她必须冷静，两个生命在她手里呢！她那一刀看似随意的对着二奶奶的肚子划下，力道却是紧紧的控制着，既没有切的太深，也没划的太长，这只是试验的一刀，为的是确定二奶奶皮肉的厚度。毕竟现在没有照出手术过程的仪器在旁边，她要剖腹取子，只能凭着自己的经验和感觉。只要一个不小心，就可能划到孩子，留下疤痕不说，最大的可能是直接让婴儿失去生命。柳蓉额间沁出汗水：“陈妈妈，给我擦汗，不能让汗水流到我眼睛附近！”“是！”陈妈妈赶忙去取布巾给柳蓉擦汗。柳蓉却是眼睛一眨不眨的盯着自己划下的位置，划的太浅了，要稍微深一点，手上控制着力道缓缓加重，皮肉缓缓打开的更多，其中流出的猩红也影响她的判断力。还不够，柳蓉又加重一丝力道，孕妇身子微微一抖，柳蓉赶忙稳住匕首，一动不动：“来人将二奶奶压住，不能让她乱动，不然孩子就可能伤到孩子了。”不知什么时候，丫鬟婆子都已经退出去，此刻屋中除了帮着柳蓉的李妈妈和陈妈妈，便只剩下刘大奶奶，太夫人，大夫人，二夫人，史御医，还有靠近门口站着，稍微能看到屋子里的情况，又看不大清楚的柳博和上官辰。“我说的话没听到吗？快帮我摁住二奶奶！”见没有人上前，柳蓉忍不住大声道。史御医微微摇头，上前帮着柳蓉摁住二奶奶，如此执着医术，执着救人的好苗子，可惜了，这就当他帮这蓉姐儿第一次，也是最后一次吧。大夫人见史御医上前，想了想，对着二夫人和刘大奶奶吩咐道：“你们扶着太夫人出去，免得吓到了，顺便带二少爷和太子世子也出去，我留在这里帮忙。”说着话，大夫人也跟着上前帮着柳蓉摁住二奶奶。有了两人的帮忙，柳蓉立刻继续，终于，皮肉下，露出皱巴巴，微微发红的皮肤，柳蓉面上露出笑容，这是婴儿身体。确定婴儿的位置，柳蓉深吸一口气，开始增大纵向的口子，之前的口子不够大，还不能够将婴儿取出。不一会，婴儿的一部分身体露出，那仅仅缠在婴儿身上的脐带也露了出来。而婴儿的身体，红的有些可怕，柳蓉心中一惊，没有将孩子快速取出，先用搁在一旁剪脐带的剪子直接将脐带剪开，才快速将孩子取出递给李妈妈。“拍孩子屁股，让他哭出声来！”不一会便听哇的一声，孩子的洪亮的哭声传出，叫产房中的所有人都忍不住松一口气，望着柳蓉的目光也充满了惊奇。这可是这个世界上，第一次，有人剖腹取子，孩子活下来！柳蓉却是吩咐完李妈妈，便专注的盯着手上的针线。在所有人惊讶的目光中一气呵成的将针线穿好。这是第二场硬仗，以手术伤口的长度，她最少最少要缝上二十针。在这样一个没有手术缝合专用针和羊肠线的情况下，这一切的一切对柳蓉来说都是一个考验。柳蓉咬紧下唇，开始将针穿入二奶奶的皮肤，不一样的用针触感让她缝伤口缝的很是不顺畅，即便如此，她的手都没有一丝颤抖。这是作为一个医务人员，特别是外科医务人员最基本的素质，绝不因为自己的一丝一毫不稳定伤到自己手中的病患。陈妈妈看着柳蓉艰难的缝合皮肤，嘴巴开了开，又合了合。“不然让陈妈妈帮你替二奶奶缝合伤口吧！”大夫人有些看不过去柳蓉的针法，终于开口说道。柳蓉看着伤口殷出来的血，又看看自己才缝合三针，这样下去会保不住二奶奶，终于对着大夫人点头：“陈妈妈，你来缝合伤口，速度要快，也要细致。”眼看陈妈妈就要接过她手中的针和线，柳蓉眉头一皱：“先去用烈酒洗手，洗完手再来替二奶奶缝合，不然手上的细菌会让二奶奶感染的！”陈妈妈微微一愣，虽然不知道柳蓉说什么，还是重重的点了点头，快步走到烈酒盆子前洗手，洗了三遍，才走回到柳蓉跟前。柳蓉这片刻又缝了两针，才将针和线递给陈妈妈。不愧是专门对针线有研究的古代女人，在柳蓉手上别扭无比的针线，到得陈妈妈手中竟是意外的顺畅，即便第一次接触，陈妈妈缝合二奶奶的伤口的速度也比柳蓉快上许多。柳蓉微微松口气，头便一阵发晕，身子一晃，却被一双大手扶住。柳蓉抬头，便见之前帮她忙的史御医维持着一种震惊，加惊奇的表情看着她，仿佛看什么奇怪的东西一般，直到看得柳蓉全身不自在，开口说对方：“史御医能不这样看着我吗？”史御医才满脸尴尬，他实在是太惊讶了，恐怕这辈子的转折和离奇都没有今日多。一个小姑娘给人剖腹取子，做这个从没有人成功，也绝对不会成功的事情，竟然出乎意料的成功了。还创出这样匪夷所思的伤口缝合方式，这简直就是医学界的天才，如此想着，史御医如同看到稀世珍宝一般，更是开口对着柳蓉问道：“你怎么想到用针线缝合伤口这样的方法的？这样的方法若运用到战场上，给那些受伤的士兵用，不知能救回多少边关战士。”柳蓉一呆，随即苦笑，听史御医的意思，现在并没有伤口缝合的方法，她却是无意中弄出了个首创，也不知道会不会对这个世界有所影响。只是她现在都累的快虚脱了，竟还碰到这么一个好奇宝宝：“大约因为我是女人吧，看针线活看多了，就想着既然能缝合布匹，为什么不能缝合伤口吧。”说着，柳蓉不想让史御医继续问自己问题，便对着李妈妈随口问道：“李妈妈，孩子是男孩还是女孩。”李妈妈小心翼翼的捧着用提前准备的百家布包裹着的婴儿，听到柳蓉的问题不禁一愣：“孩子都是你接生的，你竟不知道孩子是男是女。”“还真不知道。”柳蓉摸摸鼻子，之前她实在太紧张了，哪里还顾得上看孩子是男是女。也是运气好，二奶奶的身体也不错，让这次手术除了开刀艰难了一些外，没有出现任何不好的问题。病人也没有大出血的情况出现，不然就真的全完了，这会想到自己是在什么样的条件下，用着什么样的工具做的手术，柳蓉都忍不住后背一阵冷汗。“是个儿子，二奶奶以后终于有依靠了！”李妈妈不禁笑起，这一刻，蓉姐儿看起来才像个真正的孩子，之前无论是争取救二奶奶，还是为二奶奶做手术，都一点都不像孩子。如此一想，又忍不住心疼，竟让这么个孩子为了二奶奶和二奶奶的孩子付出这么多。万一太夫人揪着蓉姐儿之前说的话，要逐蓉姐儿出家门可如何是好？听到李妈妈的回答，蓉姐儿也忍不住呼出一口气，还好是男孩，这样的方式生产后，以后可就没有办法再生孩子了。“缝好了，蓉姐儿，你来看看，这样可以吗？”陈妈妈弄好，对着柳蓉询问道。柳蓉赶忙过去看，伤口缝的很精致，比她缝合的好多了。真没想到她这个用手术刀的人，用日常的针线缝伤口竟还不如一个绣花的。“这样就没事了，注意不要让伤口碰到水，也不要碰到什么不干净的东西，二奶奶放到伤口附近，或贴着伤口的东西，都要用热水煮沸，太阳暴晒，才能给二奶奶用。你们取放这些东西的时候，自己的手也要用烈酒泡了之后才能碰。”柳蓉仔细的吩咐道，现在还不算完，后面伤口愈合的时间才是关键，只要一个不好，都可能要了二奶奶的命啊。“诶，都记住了。”李妈妈畅快的应着。“既然都弄好了，我们便出去吧，屋子里人多也不好，正好出去告诉大家这个好消息。”一旁笑看着的柳蓉仔细吩咐的大夫人笑着对柳蓉说道。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/houmenyinu/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 9: Cesarean Section \"Ah!\" Grandma Liu couldn't help but exclaimed: \"Sister Rong is crazy, she...she is not saving people, she is clearly killing people!\" Although the Tai Furen was also frightened, she grabbed the Eldest Madam's arm tightly, only pulling the Eldest Madam to distract half of her frightened thoughts. The second lady couldn't help but cover her face. It's over, it's over. If such a body is seen by the in-laws, it will probably be destroyed. No, if the second mistress goes, I will send Sister Rong directly to the official and blame everything on her! No, it wasn’t pushing, it was a good thing she did! Doctor Shi turned his face away. Sister Rong was too naughty. If she kept paddling like this, if she missed it... no, I'm afraid she would definitely miss it! It's a pity that such a smart girl is a good candidate to study medicine. Hey, I'm afraid it will be ruined today! Although Liu Bo didn't like his second grandmother giving birth to his younger brother, he couldn't help but close his eyes when he saw this scene. I'm afraid his stepmother really wouldn't survive this time. Shangguan Chen frowned. Although he supported Liu Rong before, he couldn't help but worry in his heart now. Even if he is a normal person, he may be finished if this continues, let alone a pregnant woman with a baby in her belly. Liu Rong, however, was completely focused. She originally didn't want to cut it vertically from the bottom of the navel to the top of the vagina. After all, this method would affect a woman's next pregnancy and increase the risk of uterine rupture during the second mistress' second pregnancy. But now, in the case of the second wife, it was too late to go horizontally, because only vertically can the least amount of blood flow and the child be taken out the fastest. In the current situation, there is no blood transfusion tool to replenish the blood in the pregnant woman's body, and it must be done in a way that minimizes bleeding. Liu Rong took a deep breath, she had to hurry! Otherwise, too much blood will be lost, and the pregnant woman will not be able to survive. But the more you want to go faster, the slower your hands become. She must calm down, she must calm down, two lives are in her hands! Her knife seemed to be casually slashing at Second Grandma's belly, but the force was tightly controlled. It did not cut too deep or too long. This was just a test knife to determine the thickness of Second Grandma's skin and flesh. After all, there were no instruments nearby to show the surgical process. She had to rely on her own experience and feelings when she wanted to perform a laparotomy to retrieve the baby. As long as one is not careful, the child may be scratched, leaving scars, and the greatest possibility is that the baby may directly lose his life. Sweat broke out on Liu Rong's forehead: \"Mother Chen, wipe my sweat. Don't let the sweat get near my eyes!\" \"Yes!\" Mother Chen hurriedly went to get a cloth to wipe Liu Rong's sweat. Liu Rong, however, stared at the position she had made without blinking. The stroke was too shallow and she needed to be slightly deeper. The control force on her hand gradually increased, and the skin and flesh slowly opened more. The scarlet flowing out of it also affected her judgment. If it wasn't enough, Liu Rong added a little more strength. The pregnant woman's body trembled slightly. Liu Rong quickly stabilized the dagger without moving: \"Someone will hold the second grandma down. Don't let her move around, otherwise the child may be hurt.\" I don't know when, the maid and the mother-in-law have already After exiting, except for Mother Li and Mother Chen who were helping Liu Rong, the only ones left in the room were Aunt Liu, the Tai Madam, the First Madam, the Second Madam, Doctor Shi, and Liu Bo and Shangguan Chen who were standing near the door and could see the situation in the room a little but couldn't see clearly. \"Didn't you hear what I said? Help me hold down the second grandma!\" Seeing that no one came forward, Liu Rong couldn't help shouting. Dr. Shi shook his head slightly and stepped forward to help Liu Rong hold down the second mistress. It was a pity that he was so dedicated to medical skills and saving people. This should be regarded as the first and last time he helped Sister Rong. When the eldest lady saw Imperial Doctor Shi coming forward, she thought for a while and ordered to the second lady and Grandma Liu: \"You guys help the eldest lady out, so as not to be frightened. By the way, take the second young master and the crown prince out too. I'll stay here to help.\" After speaking, the eldest lady also stepped forward to help Liu Rong hold down the second grandmother. With the help of the two people, Liu Rong immediately continued. Finally, wrinkled and slightly red skin was exposed under the skin, and a smile appeared on Liu Rong's face. This was a baby's body. After confirming the baby's position, Liu Rong took a deep breath and began to enlarge the longitudinal opening. The previous opening was not big enough to take out the baby. After a while, part of the baby's body was exposed, and the umbilical cord that was only wrapped around the baby was also exposed. The baby's body was red and frightening. Liu Rong was shocked. Instead of taking the baby out quickly, she first cut the umbilical cord directly with the scissors that had been set aside for cutting the umbilical cord. Then she quickly took out the baby and handed it to Mother Li. \"Slap the baby's butt and make him cry!\" After a while, a loud cry was heard, and everyone in the delivery room couldn't help but breathe a sigh of relief, and looked at Liu Rong with surprise. This is the first time in this world that someone has performed a Caesarean section and the child survived! Liu Rong, however, finished instructing Mother Li and then focused on the needlework in her hand. Threading the needle and thread in one go while everyone looked at her in surprise. This was the second tough battle. Due to the length of the surgical wound, she would need at least twenty stitches. In such a situation where there are no special needles and catgut for surgical suturing, all of this is a test for Liu Rong. Liu Rong bit her lower lip and began to pierce the needle into the second grandma's skin. The different feeling of the needle made her stitch the wound very uncomfortable. Even so, her hands did not tremble at all. This is the most basic quality of a medical staff, especially a surgical medical staff. You will never hurt the patients in your hands because of your own instabilities. Mother Chen watched Liu Rong suturing the skin with difficulty, opening and closing her mouth. \"Otherwise, let Mother Chen help you sew up Second Mistress's wound!\" The eldest lady couldn't stand Liu Rong's stitching skills, and finally said. Liu Rong looked at the blood pouring out of the wound, then looked at herself before suturing it.", "translated": true, "title_en": "Chapter 9"}